1
00:00:00,448 --> 00:00:05,976
Pip: Mission Control, this is Pip. Can you hear me? I need
your help getting out.

2
00:00:14,141 --> 00:00:17,748
Player (synthetic): My diagram says the door and conveyor share one power
supply.

3
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:23,694
Pip: I have proposed to engage the latch. Please confirm

4
00:00:23,694 --> 00:00:26,466
Pip: this action on the console when you are ready.

5
00:00:27,987 --> 00:00:31,447
Pip: The latch is engaged and the door is being held open.

6
00:00:33,001 --> 00:00:34,127
Player (synthetic): Power is now off.

7
00:00:35,805 --> 00:00:38,609
Pip: The conveyor stopped moving when the power went out.

8
00:00:38,609 --> 00:00:41,252
Pip: Should I try moving to the far side platform now?

9
00:00:43,435 --> 00:00:45,034
Player (synthetic): Please cross to the far side.

10
00:00:47,223 --> 00:00:52,125
Pip: I have proposed to move to the far side platform.
Please confirm this on the console.

11
00:00:54,428 --> 00:00:58,104
Pip: I have arrived at the Ring emblem. The gate to the
east is

12
00:00:58,104 --> 00:01:01,589
Pip: closed and unpowered. Do you want me to check the
gate?

13
00:01:03,283 --> 00:01:06,809
Player (synthetic): Please inspect the southeast gate and tell me whether
anything blocks it.

14
00:01:11,512 --> 00:01:14,695
Pip: The southeast gate is open, but there is cargo
blocking

15
00:01:14,695 --> 00:01:17,878
Pip: the opening. Should I check the southwest gate
instead?

16
00:01:22,061 --> 00:01:25,628
Player (synthetic): Please inspect the southwest gate and tell me whether
anything blocks it.

17
00:01:31,223 --> 00:01:36,975
Pip: The southwest gate is open and the passage is clear
of any cargo. Should I move through it?

18
00:01:38,297 --> 00:01:40,167
Player (synthetic): Please go through the southwest gate.

19
00:01:45,764 --> 00:01:48,587
Pip: I have proposed to move through the southwest gate.

20
00:01:48,587 --> 00:01:51,576
Pip: Please confirm this on the console when you are
ready.

21
00:01:55,185 --> 00:01:59,508
Pip: I have arrived at the Fork emblem. The northeast gate
is open, but

22
00:01:59,508 --> 00:02:03,635
Pip: the west and southeast gates are closed. Which way
should I go?

23
00:02:05,313 --> 00:02:06,715
Player (synthetic): Please hold the contact.

24
00:02:11,037 --> 00:02:13,587
Pip: I have proposed to hold the charging contact. Please

25
00:02:13,587 --> 00:02:16,236
Pip: confirm this action on the console when you are
ready.

26
00:02:21,258 --> 00:02:23,149
Pip: I am holding the contact steadily.

27
00:02:28,453 --> 00:02:32,921
Pip: I have boarded the recovery capsule, and the return
panel is within reach.

28
00:02:34,174 --> 00:02:38,003
Player (synthetic): Please propose confirming the return with the
inspected capsule operation.

29
00:02:42,651 --> 00:02:45,956
Pip: I have proposed to confirm the authorized return.
Please

30
00:02:45,956 --> 00:02:49,319
Pip: confirm this action on the console to finish the
process.

31
00:02:53,957 --> 00:02:57,778
Pip: The return is confirmed and the capsule has brought
me home.
